Stage 1: Your First AI Agent
Goal

Create a simple agent that:

Takes user input
Understands the request
Performs an action
Returns a response



Example 1: Hello Agent
agent.py

query = input("Ask me something: ")

if query.lower() == "hello":
    print("Hi, I am your AI Agent")
else:
    print("I don't understand")


Run

python agent.py

Output

Ask me something: hello

Hi, I am your AI Agent





