Real AI Agent Version

Later you'll replace the simple calculator with an LLM (GPT/OpenAI).

User Question
      |
      v
AI Agent
      |
      +--> Memory
      |
      +--> Tools
      |
      +--> LLM
      |
      v
Response
For now, remember:

tools.py = Agent's skills/tools
memory.py = Agent's memory
main.py = Agent's brain/controller

This is the simplest agent architecture and a great first step before learning OpenAI, LangChain, or CrewAI.

